<h1>Backfill historical data</h1>
<p>When building a new pipeline to a destination system, you often need to load historical data from your source in addition to new events flowing forward. This recipe shows how to backfill data alongside live event streaming.</p>

<h2>Overview</h2>
<p>Backfilling typically involves:</p>
<ol>
<li>Setting up your <a href="/concepts-connectors">connectors</a> and <a href="/concepts-pipelines">pipeline</a> for live event streaming</li>
<li>Running a separate backfill process to pull historical records</li>
<li>Ensuring the backfill and live pipeline don't duplicate events</li>
</ol>

